# over the atomic orbit; on a measurement it is found on one of the ζ
# branches and ALWAYS crosses the critical line where all the zeros lie.
# The four tests implement this picture with the modern apparatus and KEEP
# the suite's honesty standard: every measured verdict is a real theorem;
# the ζ mapping (orbit phase ↔ zeta ordinate, Dirac-string ray ↔ Re s = 1/2)
# is the semiclassical Hilbert–Pólya dictionary, stated as such in the notes.
